    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/5/1/51012.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 99,
    "turn_text": "Tricia, can I ask the question of Tom? Yeah, please. Tom, one of the things that I feel like from the viewer point of view is an increasing amount of news coverage is of news channels covering each other. If you watch Brian Stelter, easily the core of his broadcast is about Fox News. If you watch Fox, you see what, you know, is that a good thing? I can't imagine what the Cronkite badmapping jet only.",
