        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Democratic lawmakers may be hesitant to support expedited subpoena enforcement due to fear of future Republican misuse of power.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Political party control influences decisions about institutional power structures within Congress.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Subpoena enforcement should prioritize speed and finality over procedural formality.",
