    "turn_text": "Yeah, so great question and I think the Progressive Caucus is doing some really really good work on this front in two ways one is is pinning down our most progressive members that they will stick to the core priorities, that they're not going to hold out for everything they ever wanted. Like, these are the most important things and we're all going to come together and you're going to support it if we can get these core things done. So that's what we have to do to our left flank. We have to make clear that they just like we're not going to let the Republicans hold a sausage. We're not going to let the left wing of our party hold a sausage.",
