    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/5/1/51012.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 189,
    "turn_text": "I'd like to say, obviously, from the things, the questions you ask and the things you say, you've done a lot of really good research on these subjects. But ever since New Grint Gingrich restructured the, and lowered the resources available to the house for doing research. People have been concerned that the quality of legislation, the quality of research in the house has gone down significantly. Do you feel that the facilities that are available to you in Congress today, as a Congressman, are sufficient to support the kind of research that needs to be done on these issues by you and by other Congressman?",
